<title>UK: STOCKHOLM SETS $150 MILLION THREE-YEAR BOND. [CORRECTED 9:18 GMT]</title>
<headline>STOCKHOLM SETS $150 MILLION THREE-YEAR BOND. [CORRECTED 9:18 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF STOCKHOLM</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    28.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    28.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> (Lead manager corrects full fees from 0.1875).</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> (Corrects management and underwriting fees from 0.05 and selling   concession fees from 0.1375 percent)</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
